    category: "Model- and serial-matched running belt",
    badge: "Best Overall Listing",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/s?k=SportSmith+Treadmill+Belt+Horizon+T90+TM617&tag=sktiger-20",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: null,
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "About $99 (Amazon, 6 Nov 2026)",
    priceBounds: {"low":99,"high":99},
    specs: "Horizon T90 (serial TM617) and T100 (serial TM629C) · non-directional finger splice · black diamond PVC surface · impregnated lubrication",
    pros: [
      "Matched to a model and a serial number, not just a model name",
      "Listing also names a second machine it fits, the Horizon T100 with serial TM629C",
      "Non-directional finger-splice seam, so it can be fitted either way round",
      "States the surface material and that the belt is lubricant-impregnated",
      "SportSmith lists belts for many other machines in the same format",
